### Soyuz UI strings (en-US source): tui-treemap
### The terminal UI: the disk usage treemap (Phase T7).
### Keys: <area>-<thing>, kebab-case. Keep keys identical in tr-TR/tui-treemap.ftl.

tui-treemap-hints-map = ←↑↓→ select · Enter zoom in / open · Backspace up · Tab list · { $del }/X trash · O open in pane · Shift+F10 menu · F5 rescan · Esc close
tui-treemap-hints-list = ↑↓ move · Enter open · Backspace up · C contents · L largest · Tab map · { $del }/X trash · Shift+F10 menu · Esc close
tui-treemap-hints-confirm = Enter move to trash · Esc cancel
tui-treemap-hint-switch = M map / list
tui-treemap-map = Map
tui-treemap-list = List
